\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

\subsection{Remediation Summary}
All identified Critical and High severity findings have been remediated. All Medium and Low findings have been addressed or accepted with documented risk rationale.

\textbf{Round 1 (April 5):} Initial assessment identified 27 findings; 21 remediated.\\
\textbf{Round 2 (April 6):} Forensic re-audit identified 15 additional findings; 11 remediated.

